@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = 여기에_로그인_후_받은_토큰_붙여넣기

### 1. 회원가입
POST {{baseUrl}}/member/join
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "testuser", "pw": "pass1234", "name": "테스트", "phone": "010-1234-5678"}

### 2. 로그인 (토큰 발급)
POST {{baseUrl}}/member/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "testuser", "pw": "pass1234"}

### 3. 로그인 확인
GET {{baseUrl}}/member/check
Authorization: {{token}}

### 4. 회원 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/member/list

### 5. 회원 상세
GET {{baseUrl}}/member/get/testuser

### 6. 회원정보 수정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/member/update/testuser
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "010-9999-9999"}

### 7. 회원 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/member/delete/testuser
Authorization: {{token}}

### ------------------ 게시글 ------------------

### 8. 게시글 작성
POST {{baseUrl}}/board/write
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "첫 게시글", "content": "게시판 테스트 내용 입니다."}

### 9. 게시글 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/board/list?page=1&limit=10

### 10. 게시글 상세
GET {{baseUrl}}/board/get/여기에_게시글ID

### 11. 게시글 수정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/board/update/여기에_게시글ID
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "수정된 제목"}

### 12. 게시글 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/board/delete/여기에_게시글ID
Authorization: {{token}}
